flowchart TD
    A([BeginPlay / Decision Timer]) --> B[MakeDecision]
    B --> C[UpdateContextFromBindings]
    C --> D[Read configured actor properties]
    D --> E[Normalize values if enabled]
    E --> F[Store values in UtilityAIContext]

    F --> G[DecisionManager: Evaluate Actions]
    G --> H[Action: Calculate Utility]

    H --> I[For Each Consideration]
    I --> J[DataSource: Get Input Value]
    J --> K{Response Curve Configured?}

    K -- Yes --> L[Evaluate Response Curve]
    K -- No --> M[Clamp Input to 0..1]
    L --> N[Obtain Consideration Score]
    M --> N

    N --> O[Record Consideration Debug Data]
    O --> P{More Considerations?}
    P -- Yes --> I
    P -- No --> Q{Combination Method}

    Q -- Multiply --> R[Multiply Valid Scores]
    Q -- Average --> S[Average Valid Scores]

    R --> T[Record Action Utility and Debug Data]
    S --> T
    T --> U{More Actions?}
    U -- Yes --> H
    U -- No --> V[Choose Action with Highest Utility]

    V --> W[Update CurrentAction and Selection State]
    W --> X[Refresh Debug Data]
    X --> Y{An Action Was Selected?}

    Y -- Yes --> Z[Execute Selected Action]
    Y -- No --> AA[No Action Executed]

    Z --> AB([Wait for Next Decision Interval])
    AA --> AB
    AB --> B